# ParishBSD Curated FreeBSD Application Catalog
# Format: Category|Display Name|FreeBSD pkg name|Description|requiresCap
#
# requiresCap values:
#   -               Headless / CLI / works in any compartment
#   gui             Requires graphical session (T-xpra)
#   compat-linux    Requires Linux binary compatibility (T-compat-linux)
#   compat-windows  Requires Windows compatibility / Wine (T-compat-windows)

# --- Web & Communication ---
Web|Firefox ESR|firefox-esr|Privacy-focused web browser (Extended Support Release)|gui
Web|Firefox|firefox|Modern Mozilla Firefox web browser|gui
Web|Chromium|chromium|Open-source Chromium web browser|gui
Web|Luakit|luakit|Lightweight fast WebKit browser for minimal compartments|gui
Communication|Thunderbird|thunderbird|Email, calendar, and contacts client for parish administration|gui
Communication|HexChat|hexchat|IRC chat client|gui

# --- Office & Parish Administration ---
Office|LibreOffice|libreoffice|Full office suite (Writer, Calc, Impress) for parish documents|gui
Office|AbiWord|abiword|Lightweight word processor|gui
Office|Gnumeric|gnumeric|Fast lightweight spreadsheet application|gui
Office|Okular|okular|Universal document & PDF viewer with annotation support|gui
Office|Evince|evince|Lightweight GNOME PDF and document viewer|gui
Office|Calibre|calibre|E-book library manager and document converter|gui
Office|SQLite Browser|sqlitebrowser|Visual editor for SQLite databases|gui
Office|pgAdmin 4|py311-pgadmin4|Graphical management tool for PostgreSQL vaults|gui

