Graphics|GIMP|gimp|GNU Image Manipulation Program for posters and bulletins|gui
Graphics|Inkscape|inkscape|Vector graphics editor for parish seals, flyers, and layouts|gui
Graphics|Scribus|scribus|Desktop publishing layout tool for parish newsletters|gui
Media|VLC Media Player|vlc|Versatile audio and video player (enable compartment audio output)|gui
Media|Audacity|audacity|Multi-track audio recorder and editor for sermons/choirs (enable audio)|gui
Media|OBS Studio|obs-studio|Livestreaming and sermon recording suite (enable audio)|gui

# --- Files, Security & Utilities ---
Utilities|PCManFM|pcmanfm|Lightweight file manager for browsing compartment & exchange files|gui
Utilities|Dolphin|dolphin|KDE file manager|gui
Utilities|Mousepad|mousepad|Simple graphical text editor|gui
Utilities|KeePassXC|keepassxc|Offline encrypted password manager (best used inside a Vault or Trusted compartment)|gui
Utilities|GnuPG|gnupg|OpenPGP encryption and digital signing tools|-
Utilities|Ark|ark|Archive manager for ZIP, TAR, and 7z files|gui

# --- Development & System ---
Development|Git|git|Distributed version control system|-
Development|Vim|vim|Advanced modal text editor|-
Development|tmux|tmux|Terminal multiplexer|-
Development|Geany|geany|Lightweight IDE and code editor|gui

# --- Compatibility Layers ---
Compatibility|Wine (Windows Apps)|wine|Run 32/64-bit Windows installers and portable executables|compat-windows
Compatibility|Winetricks|winetricks|Helper script to install Windows runtime libraries into Wine prefixes|compat-windows
Compatibility|Linux Compatibility Runtime|linux_base-rl9|Rocky Linux 9 userland base for Linux binaries and games|compat-linux
